# Notepad PWA

A lightweight, privacy-first, offline-capable notepad built as a Progressive Web App.

Features include:

- Real-time autosave to localStorage
- Dark mode and focus mode
- Installable PWA for offline use and home screen launch on supported devices
- Writing timer and break reminders
- Snapshot history for quick note recovery
- Typewriter sound toggle
- Ambient sound generator for focus sessions
- Full-screen and floating window support
- Download notes as TXT, HTML, PDF, and DOCX
- Keyboard shortcuts for navigation and saving

## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Production build

```bash
npm run build
```

## Notes

This app stores notes in the browser using localStorage. For backup safety, use the download actions or keyboard shortcut `Ctrl/Cmd + S`.

The project intentionally avoids collecting user data and keeps all note storage on-device.

